ardless of being quiet.So, regardless of whether Dave is quiet or not, being furry makes him green.\n\nWait, but let\'s see if there\'s any contradiction.Let\'s check other facts that might relate to Dave.\n\nFact 14: All green people are big.If Dave is green, he must be big, smart, and not nice. All round, furry, quiet people are green, big, and smart, like Dave. Therefore, Dave is big, smart, and not nice.</think>.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
