ugh.\n   - From fact 14, all rough, young people are round. Since Charlie is rough and young, he must be round.\n   - From fact 11, if someone is round, they are blue. Therefore, Charlie is blue.\n   - From fact 16, blue, round people are big. So Charlie is big.\n\n2. **Conclusion:**\n   - Charlie is blue, round, big, smart, quiet, young, and rough.\n   - Therefore, the statement \"Charlie is not blue\" is false.\n\n**Final Answer:**\nB) False",
