 From Statement 9: If something is kind, it is green. Therefore, Fiona is green.\n\n4. **Check Smart Status:**\n   - From Statement 14: Nice, green things are smart. Since Fiona is nice and green, she is smart.\n\n5. **Determine Quiet Status:**\n   - From Statement 8: Green, smart things are quiet. Since Fiona is green and smart, she is quiet.\n\n**Answer:** A) True",
