From Fact 11: If someone is round, they are blue. Therefore, Charlie would be blue.\n\n7. **Blue Individuals:**\n   - From Fact 13: If someone is blue, they are young. This aligns with Charlie being young.\n\n8. **Blue and Round Individuals:**\n   - From Fact 16: Blue, round people are big. Therefore, Charlie would be big.\n\n9. **Conclusion:**\n   - All the above facts consistently lead to the conclusion that Charlie is young.\n\n**Final Answer:**\nA) True",
