Anne is rough. Fact 18: All rough, big people are smart. Since Anne is rough and big, she must be smart. Therefore, Anne is smart. So the statement \"Anne is not smart\" is false. Therefore, the correct answer is B) False.\n\nYes, that makes sense now. I initially confused Anne's size, thinking she was small, but she's actually big because she's blue. So she's smart.\n</think>\n\nThe statement \"Anne is not smart\" is false because Anne is determined to be smart based on the given facts.\n\n**Answer: B) False**",
