ne-way implication: furry → kind.It doesn\'t say that being kind is sufficient for being furry.So just because Erin isn\'t kind doesn\'t necessarily mean she can\'t be furry, but wait, no, because if she were furry, she would have to be kind, which she isn\'t.So that\'s a contradiction.Therefore, Erin cannot be furry.\n\nAlternatively, let\'s see if there\'s any other path.Let\'s look at the other rules.Point 14 says if something is young and cold, then it\'s furry.Erin is not furry.</think>.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
