nd smart.We know Gary is smart because he's big (from point 15).But is he white?\n\nLooking at point 11: If someone is quiet and cold, then they are white.Gary is quiet, but is he cold?We don't have any information that directly says Gary is cold.Fiona is cold, but that's Fiona, not Gary.\n\nGary is not furry based on the given information.</think>.. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
