young, round, and quiet.** (Points 4, 5, and 11)\n- **Big people are rough.** (Point 9)\n- **If someone is rough, they are young.** (Point 10)\n- **If someone is young and round, they are quiet.** (Point 11)\n- **Big, young people are cold.** (Point 12)\n- **Cold people are round.** (Point 13)\n- **If someone is young and not furry, they are not round.** (Point 14)\n\nFrom the above, we can conclude that **Dave is not big** because Fiona is the only one mentioned as big, and there is no information suggesting that Dave is big.\n\n**Answer:** A) True",
