statement 15).\n   - The bear is blue because the cow chases it (statement 20).\n\n2. **Conditional Statements**:\n   - If the mouse chases the cow and the cow chases the squirrel, then the mouse visits the bear (statement 19). However, the cow does not chase the squirrel, so this condition is not met.\n   - The mouse visits the bear only if the cow chases the squirrel, which it does not.\n\n3. **Conclusion**:\n   - The mouse chases the cow, and the cow chases the bear, but there is no rule that implies the mouse chases the bear.\n   - The mouse visits the bear due to statement 19, but visiting does not equate to chasing.\n\nTherefore, the statement \"The mouse does not chase the bear\" is true.\n\n\\boxed{A}",
